# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security is deliberately NOT set yet. HSTS is cached by
# browsers and cannot be withdrawn from clients that already received it, so
# it should not be enabled until the real site is serving correctly over
# HTTPS. Add it once the site is live and validated.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
